1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000


2
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

3
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 46=
(This drama does not correspond)

5
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:42,310
- Yes!
- Yes!

8
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:43,950
- Yes!
- Yes!

9
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,510
By day, follow the banners.

10
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,760
By night, follow the lanterns.

11
00:01:51,208 --> 00:01:53,640
Make sure the units support one another
from front to rear

12
00:01:53,864 --> 00:01:55,400
and stay connected from side to side,

13
00:01:55,510 --> 00:01:56,760
so that nothing goes amiss.

14
00:01:57,384 --> 00:01:59,200
Anyone who deliberately lets
the enemy escape

15
00:01:59,448 --> 00:02:01,150
or causes delays in military operations,

16
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,590
thereby jeopardizing the mission,

17
00:02:04,590 --> 00:02:05,430
will be

18
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:07,944
beheaded and their head displayed
as a warning.

19
00:02:27,630 --> 00:02:28,430
Your Lordship.

20
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,000
It's nothing serious.

21
00:02:33,870 --> 00:02:34,750
Move out.

22
00:02:35,310 --> 00:02:37,000
Set out for the capital.

23
00:02:53,416 --> 00:02:55,100
(Upholding the Virtue
of Generations Past)

24
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,150
Old Master,

25
00:02:56,150 --> 00:02:58,790
the pirates split into three groups
and attacked the Lin Residence.

26
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:01,080
Fortunately, the Lin family was prepared

27
00:03:01,144 --> 00:03:02,728
and fought them off on separate fronts.

28
00:03:02,910 --> 00:03:04,590
After Madam killed the pirate leader,

29
00:03:04,710 --> 00:03:06,584
the City Patrol Office arrived
in time as well.

30
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:08,790
Most of the household guards
suffered only minor injuries.

31
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,130
Only two were seriously wounded.

32
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,560
The physician is treating them now.

33
00:03:13,310 --> 00:03:14,560
Their lives are not in danger.

34
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:24,800
Xu,

35
00:03:25,910 --> 00:03:27,630
how did you know

36
00:03:27,910 --> 00:03:31,840
the pirates would attack
the Lin Residence last night?

37
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:35,910
I dare not take the credit.

38
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:37,470
His Lordship and I

39
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:39,240
worked it out together.

40
00:03:39,870 --> 00:03:41,150
Jinling is the southern capital.

41
00:03:42,190 --> 00:03:43,840
Given how cunning Du Cuique is,

42
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,680
she wouldn't be naive enough to think

43
00:03:45,750 --> 00:03:47,320
that with a band of desperate outlaws,

44
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,870
she could run rampant and kill at will.

45
00:03:52,190 --> 00:03:53,960
Du Cuique had something else to rely on.

46
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,870
Du Cuique has allied herself with Wona.

47
00:04:02,590 --> 00:04:03,630
She made a show of one plan

48
00:04:03,752 --> 00:04:05,464
while secretly carrying out another.

49
00:04:05,870 --> 00:04:07,190
Revenge was only a pretext.

50
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:09,430
She planned to work
with Wona from within

51
00:04:10,056 --> 00:04:11,190
to destroy the provisions.

52
00:04:12,312 --> 00:04:13,680
When the nest is overturned,

53
00:04:14,190 --> 00:04:15,150
no egg remains intact.

54
00:04:18,008 --> 00:04:19,680
A thief can scheme for a thousand days,

55
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:22,424
but no one can guard against one
for a thousand days.

56
00:04:22,870 --> 00:04:24,240
Rather than defend passively,

57
00:04:25,870 --> 00:04:27,160
we should take the initiative.

58
00:04:28,070 --> 00:04:29,390
We might as well give her

59
00:04:29,390 --> 00:04:30,800
a taste of her own medicine

60
00:04:31,270 --> 00:04:32,270
and make Du Cuique

61
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,328
suffer the consequences
of her own scheme.

62
00:04:35,070 --> 00:04:35,750
Nanke,

63
00:04:36,950 --> 00:04:38,750
go to Duke Xiangguo's Residence tonight

64
00:04:38,808 --> 00:04:40,430
and deliver a secret letter
to His Grace.

65
00:04:40,950 --> 00:04:42,510
Now that we know the pirates' objective,

66
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,360
we can determine

67
00:04:44,510 --> 00:04:46,560
the best time for them
to burn the provisions.

68
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:48,456
That will be the perfect opportunity

69
00:04:48,504 --> 00:04:49,950
to lure them all out of hiding

70
00:04:50,168 --> 00:04:51,784
and wipe them out in one strike,

71
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:53,512
putting an end to the threat for good.

72
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:55,920
Good.

73
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:01,920
If you hadn't been at the Lin Residence,

74
00:05:02,270 --> 00:05:05,920
Jinqi couldn't have left with
peace of mind to escort the provisions.

75
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,720
You played a vital role

76
00:05:10,270 --> 00:05:12,190
in wiping out the pirates last night.

77
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:33,270
Old Master.

78
00:05:34,190 --> 00:05:34,830
Lanxiang.

79
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,160
Jinqiao.

80
00:05:37,510 --> 00:05:38,800
Fengxian fell

81
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,510
and knocked out four front teeth.

82
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,510
I heard Nanny Du say

83
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:44,940
there's an old physician
who's very skilled at treating teeth.

84
00:05:44,950 --> 00:05:46,600
I'll take Fengxian
to see him right away.

85
00:05:59,870 --> 00:06:00,430
Jinqiao.

86
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:03,680
I was wounded by the pirates.

87
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:06,248
But the pirates never even reached
the inner residence.

88
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:08,950
Didn't Lanxiang tell you to stay
in Zhichun Hall?

89
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,600
Fengxian thought
the room was too crowded

90
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:13,992
and tried to sneak back
to her own courtyard to sleep.

91
00:06:14,190 --> 00:06:16,070
Then a sudden loud noise

92
00:06:16,168 --> 00:06:18,632
startled her so badly
that her legs gave way and she fell.

93
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:20,560
She wasn't hurt anywhere else.

94
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,600
But of all places,
her mouth struck a stone,

95
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,630
knocking out her front teeth.

96
00:06:24,870 --> 00:06:26,190
She can barely speak clearly now.

97
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:29,120
Why wouldn't you listen to Lanxiang?

98
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:31,720
How will you face anyone
in public after this?

99
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,600
Then I don't want to go out anyway.

100
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,950
Go on.

101
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,950
Lanxiang,

102
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:58,720
you must be tired, too.

103
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:01,480
Go back and get some rest.

104
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:03,950
Yes.

105
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:06,630
By the way,

106
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,560
I heard

107
00:07:13,950 --> 00:07:15,870
your mother hasn't been well.

108
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,560
Then let her

109
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,950
stay at Zhichun Hall a while longer.

110
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:22,360
That way, you can tend
to her at her bedside.

111
00:07:31,270 --> 00:07:32,480
Thank you, Old Master.

112
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,390
Go on.

113
00:07:40,510 --> 00:07:41,560
This lamp

114
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:44,360
is the fire in a woman's heart.

115
00:07:45,750 --> 00:07:47,950
It has burned amid the cooking
smoke of countless homes

116
00:07:49,270 --> 00:07:51,430
and lit the way
for countless women washing clothes.

117
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,510
One lamp lights ten,

118
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,830
ten lamps light a hundred,

119
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:59,270
a hundred lamps light a thousand,

120
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:02,430
until ten thousand lamps shine bright,

121
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:05,510
turning the long night into day.

122
00:08:07,260 --> 00:08:09,900
(The Tale of the Burning Lamps)

123
00:08:12,510 --> 00:08:13,270
Wonderful.

124
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,120
Truly wonderful.

125
00:08:17,430 --> 00:08:18,800
It's beautifully written.

126
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:20,776
I also think Mister Shen Rugu's

127
00:08:20,824 --> 00:08:22,940
The Tale of the Burning Lamps
is beautifully written.

128
00:08:22,950 --> 00:08:24,600
But as Mother listened,

129
00:08:24,950 --> 00:08:26,160
she remained silent

130
00:08:26,270 --> 00:08:27,870
and never once praised it.

131
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,870
When you grow up,

132
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:36,360
you'll understand.

133
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,840
You are back.

134
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,510
Grandma has been waiting for you.

135
00:08:56,510 --> 00:08:57,600
Zhangcheng,

136
00:09:01,270 --> 00:09:02,600
go see Grandpa.

137
00:09:03,670 --> 00:09:05,150
See what he's doing.

138
00:09:06,150 --> 00:09:09,030
Let me talk with your mother.

139
00:09:09,750 --> 00:09:10,320
All right.

140
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:31,670
Old Master wants you and Father

141
00:09:31,670 --> 00:09:33,390
to stay at the residence a while longer.

142
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,910
Later, I'll cook

143
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:38,000
your favorite dishes for you.

144
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,240
There are

145
00:09:44,670 --> 00:09:46,270
plenty of women

146
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,200
in this world who can cook.

147
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:50,200
They don't need you for that.

148
00:09:55,550 --> 00:09:57,270
These hands of yours

149
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:02,360
must keep writing.

150
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:05,270
Write down what we want to say

151
00:10:08,030 --> 00:10:09,240
but don't know how to say,

152
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,910
and what we simply can't

153
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:14,870
put into words.

154
00:10:19,150 --> 00:10:19,960
All right.

155
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:28,080
Cry. Cry as hard as you can.

156
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,390
Let it all out.

157
00:10:30,664 --> 00:10:32,510
When you're done,
we'll live our lives well.

158
00:10:34,670 --> 00:10:35,750
Live with all your might,

159
00:10:37,270 --> 00:10:38,270
like wild grass,

160
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,670
without caring what anyone thinks.

161
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,360
I hoped

162
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:49,390
you'd live like wild grass.

163
00:10:50,550 --> 00:10:52,270
Not only did you do that,

164
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,840
but you've also done

165
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,080
far more

166
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:58,550
and far better

167
00:10:59,630 --> 00:11:00,480
than I ever imagined.

168
00:11:04,270 --> 00:11:05,960
You're like wild grass,

169
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,750
but also like a flower,

170
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:16,750
like

171
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:18,600
a great tree.

172
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:24,240
Not only

173
00:11:25,256 --> 00:11:27,096
have you made a good life for yourself,

174
00:11:29,910 --> 00:11:32,080
but you've helped others live well too,

175
00:11:32,790 --> 00:11:35,240
and helped them make a place
for themselves in this world.

176
00:11:37,630 --> 00:11:38,630
I'm happy.

177
00:11:41,790 --> 00:11:42,630
So happy.

178
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:50,200
Mother, are you feeling unwell?

179
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:53,000
I'll get the physician.

180
00:11:57,390 --> 00:11:58,440
I'm fine.

181
00:12:00,510 --> 00:12:01,750
I'm doing very well.

182
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:23,790
Lanxiang

183
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,440
has come to take me.

184
00:12:49,150 --> 00:12:50,080
Don't cry.

185
00:12:52,750 --> 00:12:53,670
It's a good thing.

186
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,270
A good thing.

187
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:00,870
A good thing.

188
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:04,030
A good thing.

189
00:13:09,790 --> 00:13:10,600
I

190
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:16,080
can finally be reunited

191
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:17,960
with Lanxiang.

192
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:24,080
It's been twenty-four years.

193
00:13:27,270 --> 00:13:29,510
I never had the chance
to spend enough time with her.

194
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:38,720
Now that you're all grown up,

195
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:44,000
I can leave

196
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,390
without worrying.

197
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:47,870
Mother...

198
00:13:52,270 --> 00:13:53,080
I'm going now.

199
00:14:00,870 --> 00:14:02,080
Don't worry, Mother.

200
00:14:05,270 --> 00:14:06,840
I'll take good care of myself.

201
00:14:13,670 --> 00:14:14,550
Mother...

202
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:26,080
In this life,

203
00:14:28,910 --> 00:14:30,790
having a daughter like you

204
00:14:34,670 --> 00:14:35,670
has been such a blessing.

205
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:41,790
Such a blessing.

206
00:14:44,670 --> 00:14:45,480
Mother.

207
00:14:51,410 --> 00:14:54,340
♪The wind blows past distant hills♪

208
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:58,630
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

209
00:14:59,660 --> 00:15:03,330
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

210
00:15:03,850 --> 00:15:06,640
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

211
00:15:07,570 --> 00:15:10,830
♪The years are calluses in our palms♪

212
00:15:11,950 --> 00:15:14,950
♪And the worries
etched between our brows♪

213
00:15:16,230 --> 00:15:20,210
♪Birds carry twigs into the distance♪

214
00:15:20,500 --> 00:15:23,130
♪While two pairs of eyes
watch from below♪

215
00:15:23,220 --> 00:15:23,910
Lanxiang.

216
00:15:26,170 --> 00:15:29,860
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

217
00:15:30,370 --> 00:15:34,130
♪Snow falls white upon the eaves♪

218
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:38,940
♪Four seasons
wax and wane, year after year♪

219
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:42,210
♪Whose footsteps come and go?♪

220
00:15:42,940 --> 00:15:46,530
♪You're a river flowing to shore♪

221
00:15:47,020 --> 00:15:50,330
♪You're a cloud passing over
the mountains♪

222
00:15:51,170 --> 00:15:55,400
♪The journey home
always carries joy and sorrow♪

223
00:15:55,720 --> 00:16:00,090
♪People gather, then part♪

224
00:16:01,350 --> 00:16:04,100
♪Regret is a letter wishing you well♪

225
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:04,750
Lanxiang.

226
00:16:05,030 --> 00:16:05,720
Don't cry.

227
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,240
Your mother

228
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:09,670
was blessed.

229
00:16:10,150 --> 00:16:14,060
♪Back home,
leaves fall upon the blue-tiled roofs♪

230
00:16:14,260 --> 00:16:18,010
♪Leaving only a little house behind♪

231
00:16:32,670 --> 00:16:34,390
As long as there's something
to hope for,

232
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:35,720
no matter how hard life gets,

233
00:16:35,910 --> 00:16:37,030
you can make it through.

234
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:38,270
I ate the drumstick

235
00:16:38,270 --> 00:16:39,150
so I could run faster

236
00:16:39,150 --> 00:16:40,750
and catch up with you two.

237
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:43,360
Whatever happens, don't be afraid.

238
00:16:43,510 --> 00:16:44,630
Come home to your parents.

239
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:45,910
Today, you've come home.

240
00:16:45,992 --> 00:16:47,600
That makes it a good day for our family.

241
00:16:47,790 --> 00:16:48,550
Isn't it beautiful?

242
00:16:49,630 --> 00:16:50,320
Take it.

243
00:16:51,510 --> 00:16:54,360
Later, I'll tidy the place up
and make it into a proper home.

244
00:16:54,424 --> 00:16:56,080
It'll be a good place
for the three of us.

245
00:16:57,150 --> 00:16:57,960
It's beautiful.

246
00:16:58,440 --> 00:16:59,240
I like it.

247
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:01,550
It's flying!

248
00:17:02,790 --> 00:17:04,240
It's flying so high!

249
00:17:22,260 --> 00:17:26,060
(Back Courtyard
of a Medical Hall in Jinling)

250
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:01,310
Good horse. Nice horse.

251
00:18:01,512 --> 00:18:02,920
I'll only ride you for a moment.

252
00:18:27,350 --> 00:18:27,880
Young Lady.

253
00:18:31,750 --> 00:18:32,350
Be careful.

254
00:18:36,696 --> 00:18:37,440
Are you all right?

255
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:40,240
Sir!

256
00:18:42,968 --> 00:18:44,690
You didn't hurt yourself just now,
did you?

257
00:18:46,590 --> 00:18:47,510
I'm fine.

258
00:18:47,510 --> 00:18:48,550
I didn't get hurt at all.

259
00:18:49,310 --> 00:18:50,830
Are you here to see the physician?

260
00:18:51,128 --> 00:18:52,808
I'm accompanying my sister-in-law.

261
00:18:53,270 --> 00:18:54,590
She said I talk too much

262
00:18:54,590 --> 00:18:55,790
and sent me outside.

263
00:18:56,590 --> 00:18:58,000
What brings you to the medical hall?

264
00:18:58,120 --> 00:18:59,440
Are you here for treatment, too?

265
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,240
It's my horse that's unwell.

266
00:19:01,750 --> 00:19:03,270
I'm leaving it here for a few days

267
00:19:03,270 --> 00:19:04,350
to recover.

268
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:07,750
So it's your horse.

269
00:19:08,510 --> 00:19:09,880
No wonder I took to it right away.

270
00:19:10,568 --> 00:19:11,960
Do you like riding horses too?

271
00:19:12,008 --> 00:19:14,260
I secretly rode one
a couple of times when I was little.

272
00:19:14,270 --> 00:19:16,424
My eldest brother even said
I had a natural talent for it.

273
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:17,680
But

274
00:19:18,070 --> 00:19:19,110
Mother said

275
00:19:19,304 --> 00:19:21,480
riding wasn't something
a young lady should learn,

276
00:19:21,656 --> 00:19:22,750
so she wouldn't let me.

277
00:19:23,960 --> 00:19:25,000
Riding isn't difficult.

278
00:19:25,550 --> 00:19:26,830
When you get the chance,

279
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:28,640
practice more and you'll learn.

280
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:34,590
First I need the chance.

281
00:19:37,310 --> 00:19:37,960
Someday,

282
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:40,160
I'll learn to ride.

283
00:19:41,110 --> 00:19:42,270
I'll travel far and wide

284
00:19:42,960 --> 00:19:44,640
and see all the wonders of the land.

285
00:19:49,110 --> 00:19:50,070
In this world,

286
00:19:52,270 --> 00:19:54,350
most men seek rank and fortune.

287
00:19:55,310 --> 00:19:56,070
As for women,

288
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:57,920
most hope for an accomplished husband

289
00:19:58,720 --> 00:19:59,880
and dutiful children.

290
00:20:02,070 --> 00:20:03,350
An ambition like yours

291
00:20:03,920 --> 00:20:04,720
is rather unusual.

292
00:20:07,310 --> 00:20:09,030
You seem to be a scholar, too.

293
00:20:09,208 --> 00:20:11,000
Don't you wish
to enter official service?

294
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:15,270
I'm rather awkward by nature

295
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:17,680
and not suited to officialdom.

296
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:20,750
In this life,

297
00:20:21,960 --> 00:20:23,440
I only wish to travel far and wide

298
00:20:23,750 --> 00:20:25,200
and see all the wonders of the land.

299
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:30,590
It seems we share the same ambition.

300
00:20:33,310 --> 00:20:34,480
How wonderful.

301
00:20:35,880 --> 00:20:37,240
As long as a man has the courage,

302
00:20:37,680 --> 00:20:39,590
he can live life on his own terms.

303
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:49,640
Where will you go next?

304
00:20:50,600 --> 00:20:51,896
After the Chinese New Year,

305
00:20:52,008 --> 00:20:54,160
I'm thinking
of traveling to Yunnan and Guizhou.

306
00:21:04,550 --> 00:21:05,200
Sir,

307
00:21:05,496 --> 00:21:07,464
meeting again means fate
has brought us together.

308
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:08,440
This time,

309
00:21:08,750 --> 00:21:10,880
please tell me your name

310
00:21:10,880 --> 00:21:12,000
and where you live.

311
00:21:12,184 --> 00:21:14,200
Tomorrow, I'll have
my Fourth Brother visit you

312
00:21:14,310 --> 00:21:15,590
to thank you for saving my life.

313
00:21:16,070 --> 00:21:17,480
Our two families can become close,

314
00:21:17,550 --> 00:21:19,256
and from then on,
we'll be like one family.

315
00:21:20,310 --> 00:21:21,030
Later,

316
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:22,680
when you go to Guizhou

317
00:21:22,960 --> 00:21:23,680
and Yunnan,

318
00:21:24,310 --> 00:21:26,510
if you come across anything beautiful
or interesting,

319
00:21:26,616 --> 00:21:28,400
you can write
to my Fourth Brother about it.

320
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:30,648
I'll help my Fourth Brother
write back to you.

321
00:21:32,680 --> 00:21:34,984
It's rare to meet someone
who shares the same aspirations.

322
00:21:35,310 --> 00:21:36,350
Enjoying something alone

323
00:21:36,552 --> 00:21:38,392
isn't as good as sharing it with others.

324
00:21:46,110 --> 00:21:47,350
You're right.

325
00:21:48,270 --> 00:21:49,310
Enjoying something alone

326
00:21:49,752 --> 00:21:51,512
isn't as good as sharing it with others.

327
00:21:57,310 --> 00:21:59,030
May I ask

328
00:21:59,510 --> 00:22:01,590
where you live
and your place among your siblings?

329
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:03,200
Give me a few days to prepare.

330
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:05,590
In ten days, I will be sure to visit.

331
00:22:06,160 --> 00:22:07,070
My surname is Lin.

332
00:22:07,336 --> 00:22:09,310
I'm the second among
the sisters in my family.

333
00:22:09,550 --> 00:22:10,790
I live on Yanling Lane.

334
00:22:12,920 --> 00:22:13,750
Yanling Lane?

335
00:22:14,720 --> 00:22:15,550
The Lin Residence?

336
00:22:16,200 --> 00:22:17,640
Then Marquis Jing'an is...

337
00:22:20,200 --> 00:22:21,310
He's my eldest brother.

338
00:22:22,640 --> 00:22:24,160
My brother is a good man.

339
00:22:24,170 --> 00:22:25,830
He chooses his friends
for their character

340
00:22:25,848 --> 00:22:27,720
and doesn't care
about family background.

341
00:22:30,750 --> 00:22:31,550
Sir,

342
00:22:32,680 --> 00:22:35,000
you promised you'd come visit.

343
00:22:36,070 --> 00:22:37,160
A gentleman keeps his word.

344
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:39,200
In ten days,

345
00:22:39,790 --> 00:22:41,830
I will be sure
to pay my respects to Old Master Lin.

346
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:44,350
It's a promise.

347
00:23:09,110 --> 00:23:10,030
I've come today

348
00:23:10,184 --> 00:23:12,456
to ask for the hand
of your family's Second Young Lady.

349
00:23:12,792 --> 00:23:14,350
This may seem like a hasty decision,

350
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:16,550
but I have given it careful thought.

351
00:23:16,872 --> 00:23:18,160
Every word comes from my heart.

352
00:23:18,170 --> 00:23:19,990
I would never treat this as
a trifling matter.

353
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:22,110
Old Master Lin,

354
00:23:22,790 --> 00:23:24,590
I ask that you consider my proposal

355
00:23:26,152 --> 00:23:27,672
in light of my sincerity.

356
00:23:41,680 --> 00:23:42,640
Very well.

357
00:23:45,310 --> 00:23:46,590
Our two families

358
00:23:48,110 --> 00:23:49,680
have known each other for generations.

359
00:23:50,248 --> 00:23:51,590
There's no need to be so formal.

360
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:53,590
Sit down and we'll talk.

361
00:23:55,432 --> 00:23:57,608
Thank you for offering me
a seat, Old Master Lin.

362
00:24:11,030 --> 00:24:11,590
Hurry up.

363
00:24:13,496 --> 00:24:14,960
You're always saying you're old,

364
00:24:15,030 --> 00:24:17,096
but you're getting quicker
on your feet by the day.

365
00:24:18,160 --> 00:24:19,270
The suitor who came today

366
00:24:19,270 --> 00:24:20,860
is from a respectable scholarly family.

367
00:24:20,960 --> 00:24:23,784
His family is well-off, and he
even a Presented Scholar.

368
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:24,720
I'm telling you,

369
00:24:24,790 --> 00:24:26,070
you'd better behave yourself.

370
00:24:26,104 --> 00:24:27,784
You won't find another chance like this.

371
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:28,830
A Presented Scholar?

372
00:24:28,900 --> 00:24:30,760
Matchmakers will say anything
to make a match.

373
00:24:30,800 --> 00:24:33,000
At best, he's probably only
a provincial graduate.

374
00:24:33,010 --> 00:24:34,590
What's wrong with a provincial graduate?

375
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:35,960
There are so many scholars in the world.

376
00:24:36,070 --> 00:24:37,624
How many of them ever pass
the provincial examination?

377
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:39,550
Mother, be reasonable.

378
00:24:42,400 --> 00:24:43,590
I'm already thirty-five.

379
00:24:44,000 --> 00:24:45,350
A respectable scholarly family,

380
00:24:45,510 --> 00:24:47,590
well-off, and he's passed
the provincial examination.

381
00:24:47,784 --> 00:24:49,960
What decent man with all that
would still be unmarried?

382
00:24:50,632 --> 00:24:52,984
There must be something
seriously wrong with him.

383
00:24:53,160 --> 00:24:55,030
Mother, please don't push
your own daughter

384
00:24:55,030 --> 00:24:56,070
into a pit of fire.

385
00:24:58,030 --> 00:24:58,960
Mother!

386
00:24:58,960 --> 00:24:59,640
Aren't you

387
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:01,000
still unmarried yourself?

388
00:25:01,128 --> 00:25:03,176
There's nothing
seriously wrong with you.

389
00:25:05,270 --> 00:25:06,830
Xiuwan.

390
00:25:08,550 --> 00:25:09,750
He was married before.

391
00:25:10,790 --> 00:25:12,510
His wife died many years ago.

392
00:25:13,000 --> 00:25:14,720
He didn't want to remarry before

393
00:25:15,510 --> 00:25:16,830
and spent years traveling.

394
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:18,920
He only returned to Jinling this year.

395
00:25:19,440 --> 00:25:20,510
For some reason,

396
00:25:20,510 --> 00:25:22,440
he suddenly decided he wanted
to marry again.

397
00:25:23,032 --> 00:25:24,510
Don't think too much about it yet.

398
00:25:24,640 --> 00:25:26,510
Come take a look with me first.
Let's go.

399
00:25:28,240 --> 00:25:30,720
My savior is coming to visit today.

400
00:25:30,880 --> 00:25:33,160
I know. We've prepared all
the thank-you gifts for you.

401
00:25:33,270 --> 00:25:34,640
Jincen has been waiting for him.

402
00:25:37,110 --> 00:25:39,200
And my suitor is coming today too...

403
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:40,000
Exactly.

404
00:25:40,110 --> 00:25:41,200
That's why I'm taking you

405
00:25:41,200 --> 00:25:42,310
to sneak a look at him.

406
00:25:42,376 --> 00:25:44,350
You can decide
for yourself whether you like him.

407
00:25:44,456 --> 00:25:46,888
Then you can't keep saying
I'm pushing you into a pit of fire.

408
00:25:50,510 --> 00:25:51,750
You've finally come around?

409
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:52,830
Finally?

410
00:25:54,240 --> 00:25:55,350
That's rare.

411
00:25:55,350 --> 00:25:56,830
Very rare indeed.

412
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:25,160
Come on. Let's go.

413
00:26:28,000 --> 00:26:30,230
Even if I have to support you
for the rest of your life,

414
00:26:30,240 --> 00:26:32,392
I will never let you marry
a snobbish man like that.

415
00:26:33,070 --> 00:26:33,960
Then I won't marry him.

416
00:26:34,270 --> 00:26:35,110
But Mother, you can't

417
00:26:35,110 --> 00:26:36,424
speak that way about my savior.

418
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:38,160
He's a man of noble character,

419
00:26:38,200 --> 00:26:39,160
upright and honorable.

420
00:26:39,256 --> 00:26:41,624
He's certainly not a snob
who only cares about status.

421
00:26:42,070 --> 00:26:42,880
You think he isn't

422
00:26:42,880 --> 00:26:44,310
a snob who only cares about status?

423
00:26:44,408 --> 00:26:46,328
Then why did he marry
Sixth Young Lady Zhao?

424
00:26:46,424 --> 00:26:48,520
Wasn't it because
the Zhao family was powerful?

425
00:26:49,830 --> 00:26:50,310
Let's go.

426
00:26:52,350 --> 00:26:53,270
Sixth Young Lady Zhao?

427
00:26:54,960 --> 00:26:55,790
Sir?

428
00:26:57,590 --> 00:26:58,590
He is...

429
00:26:59,032 --> 00:27:02,488
My surname is Xie, my given name is
Zhao, and my courtesy name is Xianzhang.

430
00:27:04,510 --> 00:27:05,750
Xie Zhao!

431
00:27:05,848 --> 00:27:08,328
How dare you send a matchmaker here
to propose marriage!

432
00:27:09,000 --> 00:27:10,070
Today, I swear I'll...

433
00:27:10,070 --> 00:27:10,720
I'll...

434
00:27:10,720 --> 00:27:11,920
Lingxiao,

435
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:15,510
let the two of them
speak for themselves.

436
00:27:21,350 --> 00:27:22,270
Old Master Lin,

437
00:27:23,750 --> 00:27:25,550
surely this isn't proper.

438
00:27:25,790 --> 00:27:27,440
What's improper about it?

439
00:27:28,200 --> 00:27:30,310
Her grandfather
and mother are both here.

440
00:27:30,830 --> 00:27:33,070
The two of them happened to meet,

441
00:27:33,310 --> 00:27:35,240
so they can greet each other.

442
00:27:36,790 --> 00:27:37,720
Come here.

443
00:28:00,280 --> 00:28:01,640
I sincerely wish to marry you.

444
00:28:06,344 --> 00:28:09,432
Enjoying something alone isn't
as good as sharing it with someone.

445
00:28:10,200 --> 00:28:11,510
Traveling the world alone

446
00:28:12,248 --> 00:28:13,960
isn't as good as traveling together.

447
00:28:18,070 --> 00:28:19,920
Now that you know who I am,

448
00:28:19,960 --> 00:28:22,264
how can you still dare
to come here and propose?

449
00:28:24,616 --> 00:28:26,680
Back then, I was young
and had no mind of my own.

450
00:28:27,224 --> 00:28:29,080
I let my parents' obsession
with family status

451
00:28:29,100 --> 00:28:30,890
lead me into
a marriage with the Zhao family.

452
00:28:30,960 --> 00:28:32,160
Now I understand

453
00:28:32,790 --> 00:28:33,510
what I want

454
00:28:34,200 --> 00:28:34,960
and what I seek.

455
00:28:36,424 --> 00:28:38,088
I won't make the same mistake again

456
00:28:38,264 --> 00:28:39,750
and let family status hold me back

457
00:28:39,928 --> 00:28:41,200
from missing a true match.

458
00:28:47,070 --> 00:28:48,270
What happened back then

459
00:28:49,240 --> 00:28:50,680
wasn't entirely your fault.

460
00:28:52,070 --> 00:28:53,070
I was at fault, too.

461
00:28:54,640 --> 00:28:57,070
I fell for a man of poor character

462
00:28:57,560 --> 00:28:59,720
and nearly ran away
with him without a matchmaker.

463
00:29:02,440 --> 00:29:02,960
You...

464
00:29:03,400 --> 00:29:05,160
This must never be spoken of,
even on pain of death!

465
00:29:05,200 --> 00:29:06,750
You foolish girl.

466
00:29:17,070 --> 00:29:18,590
Back then, I wasn't worthy of you yet.

467
00:29:20,310 --> 00:29:21,790
That's why Heaven made each of us

468
00:29:22,440 --> 00:29:23,550
take a longer road

469
00:29:24,830 --> 00:29:26,030
and become better people

470
00:29:26,830 --> 00:29:28,000
before we truly met.

471
00:29:34,350 --> 00:29:35,750
Now I'm worthy of you, too.

472
00:29:39,030 --> 00:29:40,440
Would you be willing to join me

473
00:29:41,960 --> 00:29:43,000
in traveling far and wide

474
00:29:43,400 --> 00:29:45,310
and seeing all the wonders of the land?

475
00:29:45,570 --> 00:29:48,660
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

476
00:29:49,030 --> 00:29:54,390
♪Yet their proud spirit fades
with wind and snow♪

477
00:29:54,640 --> 00:29:57,530
♪Bamboo shadows
embrace quiet contentment♪

478
00:29:57,750 --> 00:30:00,740
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

479
00:30:01,130 --> 00:30:06,480
♪Watching the old and new
take turns in this world♪

480
00:30:06,680 --> 00:30:12,170
♪Spring comes,
and I smile upon a garden in full bloom♪

481
00:30:12,770 --> 00:30:18,460
♪Autumn passes,
and I let the blossoms fade away♪

482
00:30:18,910 --> 00:30:22,600
♪A scroll of time slowly unfolds♪

483
00:30:22,790 --> 00:30:31,500
♪I read every joy and sorrow
behind the curtain♪

484
00:30:38,920 --> 00:30:41,640
Why do I suddenly feel like crying?

485
00:30:43,200 --> 00:30:43,960
Then cry.

486
00:30:44,110 --> 00:30:44,640
I...

487
00:30:46,550 --> 00:30:47,070
I...

488
00:31:04,420 --> 00:31:09,060
(Amid the Sea of Suffering)

489
00:31:17,030 --> 00:31:17,720
Lanxiang,

490
00:31:17,790 --> 00:31:18,680
have some soup.

491
00:31:43,310 --> 00:31:44,480
These days,

492
00:31:44,790 --> 00:31:47,240
you've been copying scriptures
and praying for Aunt Guihua,

493
00:31:47,510 --> 00:31:48,680
so you can't eat meat.

494
00:31:48,984 --> 00:31:51,304
It's the perfect chance
for me to show off my cooking.

495
00:31:53,110 --> 00:31:55,680
Your cooking
is certainly worth showing off.

496
00:31:57,750 --> 00:31:58,510
Back then,

497
00:31:58,830 --> 00:32:00,510
Old Madam Yuan had a weak stomach

498
00:32:00,920 --> 00:32:02,000
and didn't like meat,

499
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:04,240
but she still needed nourishing food.

500
00:32:04,824 --> 00:32:05,880
So I went out of my way

501
00:32:05,880 --> 00:32:08,376
to learn how to cook vegetarian dishes
from the temple monks.

502
00:32:08,552 --> 00:32:10,488
I thought all that effort
had gone to waste,

503
00:32:10,920 --> 00:32:13,400
but it turns out I learned it
so I could take care of you.

504
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:16,480
It seems that in this life,

505
00:32:16,792 --> 00:32:18,440
whether the road is bitter or sweet,

506
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:20,640
not a single step is wasted.

507
00:32:29,440 --> 00:32:30,350
These days,

508
00:32:30,696 --> 00:32:32,488
I couldn't have managed
without all of you.

509
00:32:34,680 --> 00:32:36,070
Jincen and his wife

510
00:32:36,440 --> 00:32:37,960
have helped arrange the funeral

511
00:32:38,480 --> 00:32:39,720
with such care and attention.

512
00:32:40,590 --> 00:32:43,720
Xiulai has handled the household affairs

513
00:32:44,070 --> 00:32:45,830
without giving me
a thing to worry about.

514
00:32:47,160 --> 00:32:49,400
Xiuwan has helped
look after the children

515
00:32:49,790 --> 00:32:51,880
and has them all behaving perfectly.

516
00:32:54,510 --> 00:32:55,680
Xiushu heard

517
00:32:55,832 --> 00:32:58,070
that my father wanted
to stay at a temple for a while,

518
00:32:58,248 --> 00:33:00,000
so she asked her husband
to accompany him

519
00:33:00,590 --> 00:33:03,480
into the mountains to find an elderly
monk well-versed in the scriptures.

520
00:33:06,240 --> 00:33:07,160
And then there's you,

521
00:33:09,000 --> 00:33:11,160
making something different
for every meal

522
00:33:11,608 --> 00:33:13,688
because you're afraid
I won't have an appetite.

523
00:33:14,550 --> 00:33:16,270
Lanxiang, you'd better rack your brains

524
00:33:16,376 --> 00:33:17,890
and find some new ways to praise me.

525
00:33:17,920 --> 00:33:19,310
I love hearing compliments.

526
00:33:20,968 --> 00:33:22,648
Then I won't waste words on compliments.

527
00:33:27,070 --> 00:33:28,510
Madam, Third Young Lady.

528
00:33:29,440 --> 00:33:30,720
Tongcao just sent word.

529
00:33:30,830 --> 00:33:33,310
The Yuan family's Third Granduncle
has come with his two sons,

530
00:33:33,960 --> 00:33:35,440
demanding to see Third Young Lady.

531
00:33:37,704 --> 00:33:39,176
Let them wait a little longer.

532
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:41,310
We've already got them stewing.

533
00:33:41,720 --> 00:33:44,110
We should let them stew
until they lose their patience.

534
00:33:46,790 --> 00:33:47,590
Yes.

535
00:33:55,640 --> 00:33:57,030
Lanxiang, aren't you going to ask

536
00:33:57,224 --> 00:33:58,640
what kind of show I'm putting on?

537
00:34:03,070 --> 00:34:05,590
What kind of show are you putting on?

538
00:34:10,072 --> 00:34:12,480
Even with the written agreement
His Lordship left behind

539
00:34:12,744 --> 00:34:14,310
stating that the Yuan family's property

540
00:34:14,320 --> 00:34:16,632
can only be inherited
by his daughters born of his wife,

541
00:34:17,000 --> 00:34:19,400
the Yuan clansmen won't let
the matter rest.

542
00:34:19,550 --> 00:34:22,296
They keep harping on the fact that
the Marquis's household has no son

543
00:34:22,670 --> 00:34:24,630
and plan
to have a son adopted into the family,

544
00:34:24,640 --> 00:34:27,190
so they can claim the title first
and then swallow up the estate.

545
00:34:28,360 --> 00:34:29,630
Since they're so greedy,

546
00:34:30,280 --> 00:34:31,190
they can't blame me

547
00:34:31,400 --> 00:34:32,670
for cutting them off at the root

548
00:34:32,856 --> 00:34:34,520
and ending the threat once and for all.

549
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:40,510
No wonder

550
00:34:40,710 --> 00:34:42,230
the rumors outside

551
00:34:42,760 --> 00:34:44,400
sound so convincing.

552
00:34:44,472 --> 00:34:46,840
They say Marquis Yongchang
delayed military operations,

553
00:34:47,030 --> 00:34:48,670
causing soldiers to die needlessly.

554
00:34:48,960 --> 00:34:51,320
His Majesty will not only strip him
of his title,

555
00:34:51,510 --> 00:34:52,710
but also punish him severely.

556
00:34:54,000 --> 00:34:55,230
Third Young Lady Lin

557
00:34:55,256 --> 00:34:57,920
was so frightened that she fled back
to her family with her children

558
00:34:58,000 --> 00:35:00,024
and intends
to sever all ties with the Yuan family.

559
00:35:03,144 --> 00:35:03,920
And here I thought

560
00:35:03,920 --> 00:35:05,550
you came especially to keep me company.

561
00:35:07,190 --> 00:35:08,230
Both reasons.

562
00:35:08,296 --> 00:35:10,320
I did come especially
to keep you company too.

563
00:35:13,230 --> 00:35:14,710
Madam, Third Young Lady.

564
00:35:15,320 --> 00:35:18,216
Third Young Master found out
the Yuan family came to cause trouble.

565
00:35:18,248 --> 00:35:20,320
He went out
on crutches with the two young masters

566
00:35:20,320 --> 00:35:21,490
to drive the Yuan family away.

567
00:35:21,670 --> 00:35:23,000
They exchanged only a few words

568
00:35:23,240 --> 00:35:24,880
before he started fighting with them.

569
00:35:27,560 --> 00:35:28,632
Third Young Master said

570
00:35:28,696 --> 00:35:30,500
you had already planned
to separate back then,

571
00:35:30,536 --> 00:35:31,976
so it's not too late to do it now.

572
00:35:32,480 --> 00:35:34,440
After all, the Yuan family
has always resented

573
00:35:34,440 --> 00:35:36,000
Third Young Lady for not bearing a son.

574
00:35:37,590 --> 00:35:38,670
This fire we've stirred up

575
00:35:38,920 --> 00:35:41,128
actually ended up
setting Jinqiao off first.

576
00:35:41,960 --> 00:35:43,630
Lanxiang, take your time eating.

577
00:35:43,960 --> 00:35:45,070
I'll be right back.

578
00:35:45,800 --> 00:35:46,480
All right.

579
00:36:03,800 --> 00:36:05,760
No wonder she was

580
00:36:06,216 --> 00:36:08,880
the first to sense something was wrong
with Du Cuique back then.

581
00:36:19,510 --> 00:36:20,880
Seeing Third Young Lady

582
00:36:21,144 --> 00:36:22,670
reminds me of how I used to be.

583
00:36:26,520 --> 00:36:28,440
I used to think deeply
about everything too.

584
00:36:31,736 --> 00:36:33,320
Given the circumstances back then,

585
00:36:33,656 --> 00:36:35,070
you had to think several steps ahead

586
00:36:35,510 --> 00:36:37,110
just to survive.

587
00:36:41,160 --> 00:36:42,904
My father died when I was young.

588
00:36:43,760 --> 00:36:44,800
After my mother remarried,

589
00:36:44,800 --> 00:36:46,280
she had several more children,

590
00:36:47,070 --> 00:36:48,000
both sons and daughters.

591
00:36:49,416 --> 00:36:51,510
Ever since I was little,
I was the one no one needed.

592
00:36:52,776 --> 00:36:54,320
I only ever looked out for myself.

593
00:36:55,760 --> 00:36:56,630
I never thought

594
00:36:56,630 --> 00:36:58,960
that children owed
their parents anything,

595
00:37:00,150 --> 00:37:01,070
nor did I think

596
00:37:01,230 --> 00:37:03,590
that a servant had to be loyal
to her master.

597
00:37:10,960 --> 00:37:12,190
Then I met you,

598
00:37:12,840 --> 00:37:14,960
learned to read, and began studying.

599
00:37:15,544 --> 00:37:17,512
The road ahead grew wider and brighter,

600
00:37:17,816 --> 00:37:19,320
and only then did I begin to change.

601
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:25,670
Sometimes I don't even dare imagine

602
00:37:28,190 --> 00:37:29,510
what I'd be like now

603
00:37:31,110 --> 00:37:32,440
if I'd never met you.

604
00:37:47,110 --> 00:37:48,150
I can't take the credit.

605
00:37:49,080 --> 00:37:51,144
The Buddha saves
those with whom he has affinity.

606
00:37:51,150 --> 00:37:53,390
You found your way
because you had the wisdom within you.

607
00:37:55,400 --> 00:37:56,630
Lanxiang!

608
00:38:10,670 --> 00:38:12,150
You settled it so quickly?

609
00:38:13,280 --> 00:38:14,670
The Yuan family's Third Granduncle

610
00:38:14,840 --> 00:38:16,590
accidentally took a fall,

611
00:38:17,230 --> 00:38:19,190
then made a scene and blamed us for it.

612
00:38:19,272 --> 00:38:21,480
He insisted on severing
all clan and family ties with us

613
00:38:21,590 --> 00:38:23,000
and even had the papers drawn up.

614
00:38:24,630 --> 00:38:25,360
Now,

615
00:38:25,710 --> 00:38:27,590
I'm a widow with no one to rely on,

616
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:29,510
Jinqi isn't in Jinling,

617
00:38:29,630 --> 00:38:31,110
and you're still in mourning.

618
00:38:31,360 --> 00:38:32,440
With no other choice,

619
00:38:32,710 --> 00:38:35,230
I could only sign
and seal the document in tears.

620
00:38:37,920 --> 00:38:39,480
You were right.

621
00:38:42,050 --> 00:38:43,190
The Yuan family was terrified

622
00:38:43,200 --> 00:38:45,500
of being implicated
and punished because of His Lordship.

623
00:38:45,510 --> 00:38:47,080
They were even more anxious than I was,

624
00:38:47,144 --> 00:38:50,030
dragging Jincen to the authorities
to register us as a separate household.

625
00:38:50,040 --> 00:38:51,190
It'll all be settled today.

626
00:38:53,400 --> 00:38:54,110
From now on,

627
00:38:54,520 --> 00:38:56,200
though we still share the surname Yuan,

628
00:38:56,550 --> 00:38:57,800
we'll be two separate families.

629
00:38:58,344 --> 00:39:01,380
Whatever fortune or misfortune befalls
us will have nothing to do with them.

630
00:39:16,400 --> 00:39:18,110
The Wona forces have withdrawn!

631
00:39:18,360 --> 00:39:18,800
What?

632
00:39:18,960 --> 00:39:19,630
Really?

633
00:39:20,190 --> 00:39:21,960
The Wona army has retreated!

634
00:39:22,000 --> 00:39:23,920
The Wona forces have withdrawn!

635
00:39:24,480 --> 00:39:27,030
The Wona army has retreated!

636
00:40:06,840 --> 00:40:07,800
Your Majesty,

637
00:40:08,840 --> 00:40:09,800
our forces

638
00:40:09,896 --> 00:40:11,400
attacked from both within and without.

639
00:40:11,920 --> 00:40:13,920
The Wona army was utterly routed

640
00:40:14,550 --> 00:40:15,190
and has

641
00:40:15,590 --> 00:40:17,150
retreated from the capital in haste.

642
00:40:17,256 --> 00:40:20,920
- Congratulations, Your Majesty!
- Congratulations, Your Majesty!

643
00:40:21,208 --> 00:40:23,260
(Upholding Heaven's Mandate)
In this great victory,

644
00:40:23,280 --> 00:40:25,096
Minister Han
coordinated everything properly

645
00:40:25,176 --> 00:40:26,440
and led the forces effectively.

646
00:40:26,800 --> 00:40:28,710
He truly rendered outstanding service.

647
00:40:30,230 --> 00:40:32,150
I dare not take the credit.

648
00:40:33,030 --> 00:40:35,030
It was thanks
to Your Majesty's great fortune,

649
00:40:36,230 --> 00:40:37,030
Marquis Jing'an,

650
00:40:37,224 --> 00:40:38,550
and all my fellow officials

651
00:40:38,744 --> 00:40:40,110
working together with one heart.

652
00:40:40,504 --> 00:40:42,136
You have all
rendered meritorious service

653
00:40:42,232 --> 00:40:43,608
and must be richly rewarded.

654
00:40:44,344 --> 00:40:46,860
Minister Lin, remain in the capital
and continue your service.

655
00:40:47,400 --> 00:40:49,670
I am in great need of capable men.

656
00:40:51,576 --> 00:40:53,360
Thank you for your favor, Your Majesty.

657
00:40:54,000 --> 00:40:56,510
But though I may appear well,

658
00:40:56,616 --> 00:40:58,472
I have suffered old wounds upon new ones

659
00:40:58,568 --> 00:41:00,264
and am no longer fit
for important duties.

660
00:41:01,670 --> 00:41:02,400
This time...

661
00:41:06,230 --> 00:41:07,920
This time, for the sake of the realm,

662
00:41:08,510 --> 00:41:09,550
I pushed myself

663
00:41:09,880 --> 00:41:11,360
to hold on until now.

664
00:41:11,920 --> 00:41:13,230
I have nothing left to give.

665
00:41:14,400 --> 00:41:15,670
I beg Your Majesty to show mercy

666
00:41:15,960 --> 00:41:18,280
and allow me to return
to Jinling to recuperate.

667
00:41:30,440 --> 00:41:31,030
Very well.

668
00:41:32,120 --> 00:41:33,960
You may return to Jinling to recuperate.

669
00:41:37,992 --> 00:41:39,810
Thank you for your great grace,
Your Majesty.

670
00:41:40,110 --> 00:41:41,880
I have a matter to report.

671
00:41:47,960 --> 00:41:48,710
Your Majesty,

672
00:41:52,072 --> 00:41:53,320
now that Wona has been defeated,

673
00:41:53,800 --> 00:41:56,190
