the Retired Emperor back to the capital.

677
00:42:05,840 --> 00:42:07,760
So the Retired Emperor is coming back.

678
00:42:08,890 --> 00:42:10,240
The enemy has withdrawn, too.

679
00:42:10,520 --> 00:42:12,100
The realm is at peace now.

680
00:42:13,800 --> 00:42:17,010
- Your Majesty, please bring the Retired
- Your Majesty, please bring the Retired

681
00:42:17,020 --> 00:42:19,880
- Emperor back to the capital soon.
- Emperor back to the capital soon.

682
00:42:23,700 --> 00:42:26,900
- Your Majesty, please bring the Retired
- Your Majesty, please bring the Retired

683
00:42:26,910 --> 00:42:29,784
- Emperor back to the capital soon.
